# ============================================================================
#  Cloudflare Pages — HTTP response headers  (public/_headers)
# ============================================================================
#  Cloudflare Pages reads this file and applies these headers to matching
#  paths. It is copied verbatim into the exported /out folder at build time.
#
#  The Content-Security-Policy (CSP) below is an ALLOW-LIST: the browser will
#  block any script/style/font/connection/frame/image not listed here. If you
#  add a new third-party tool, you MUST add its domain to the relevant
#  directive or it will silently fail. Domains currently allowed:
#    - challenges.cloudflare.com ......... Turnstile (contact form)
#    - static.cloudflareinsights.com ..... Cloudflare Web Analytics beacon
#    - www.googletagmanager.com .......... GA4 / Google Tag Manager
#    - www.clarity.ms / *.clarity.ms ..... Microsoft Clarity
#    - snap.licdn.com / px.ads.linkedin .. LinkedIn Insight
#    - api.fontshare.com ................. Nohemi font CSS (headings)
#    - cdn.fontshare.com ................. Nohemi font files
#    - whiz-assistant.josephpx.workers.dev  AI chat Worker (ChatWidget)
#    - formspree.io ...................... Contact form submissions
#    - *.google-analytics.com ............ GA4 data collection
#  Same-origin ('self') covers self-hosted fonts, the Cloudflare email-decode
#  script under /cdn-cgi/, and all first-party assets.
#
#  NOTE: If you deploy the optional contact-proxy Worker
#  (worker/contact-proxy-worker.js) on a *.workers.dev URL, add that exact
#  origin to `connect-src` below, or the form POST will be blocked.
# ============================================================================

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.clarity.ms https://snap.licdn.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://api.fontshare.com; font-src 'self' https://cdn.fontshare.com; img-src 'self' data: https:; connect-src 'self' https://whiz-assistant.josephpx.workers.dev https://formspree.io https://*.google-analytics.com https://*.clarity.ms https://px.ads.linkedin.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com; frame-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self' https://formspree.io; frame-ancestors 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests

# Waraq product page — site protections plus the Google font this page's design uses
/waraqpdf/*
  ! Content-Security-Policy
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self' https://formspree.io; frame-ancestors 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
